				114.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>superstitious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.855b
			</span></i>.</div>
